---
<section class="hero-static relative w-full min-h-screen overflow-hidden" id="home">
    <div class="hero-static__wash absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between pt-28 pb-8 px-6 sm:px-10">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center w-full"><span class="font-mono text-[clamp(0.68rem,1.1vw,0.82rem)] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-[var(--text-muted)]">Creator &amp; Vibe Coder</span><span class="hidden sm:inline font-mono text-[clamp(0.68rem,1.1vw,0.82rem)] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-[var(--text-muted)]">Sora Astralis © 2026</span></div>
        <div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center py-12 sm:py-16">
            <div class="hero-profile-card frosted-glass flex flex-col items-center p-6 sm:p-8 w-[min(94vw,470px)] bg-[var(--glass-beige)] border border-[var(--glass-border)] rounded-[30px] shadow-[0_24px_70px_var(--glass-shadow)]">
                <div class="hero-card__intro"><span class="card-kicker">SORA ASTRALIS / 2026</span><h1>Making small worlds<br /><em>with curious machines.</em></h1><p>AI, stories, interfaces และโปรเจกต์เล็ก ๆ ที่ค่อย ๆ เติบโตไปพร้อมกัน</p></div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center w-full pt-7 font-sans text-sm">
                    <a href="#about" class="hero-scroll-link" aria-label="เลื่อนไปส่วนเกี่ยวกับ"><span>เลื่อนลงโลดดดด</span><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v11M3.5 9.5 8 14l4.5-4.5" /></svg></a>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-[var(--accent-blue)]"><svg class="icon-spark" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m8 1 1.2 5.8L15 8l-5.8 1.2L8 15 6.8 9.2 1 8l5.8-1.2L8 1Z" /></svg><span>Astralis</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center w-full"><span class="font-mono text-[clamp(0.58rem,1vw,0.72rem)] tracking-wider uppercase text-[var(--text-muted)]">GMT+7 TH</span><span class="hidden sm:inline font-mono text-[clamp(0.58rem,1vw,0.72rem)] tracking-wider uppercase text-[var(--text-muted)]">Silver / Cyan / Pink</span></div>
    </div>
</section>
